  "body": "## Summary\n- freeze SCAN Engine v0.24 with bounded Clang declaration-filter recovery after oversized or timed-out full AST attempts\n- remove process-local Clang pointer IDs, scheduler-race telemetry, and tied set ordering from canonical projections\n- publish reproducible source ZIP/wheel plus qualification, determinism, and sealed PR5 calibration evidence\n- update the independent Anchor project documents; Hermes remains outside SCAN and reference-only in MantleOS2\n\n## Validation\n- 128 tests passed in development and clean extracted package; 3 Windows symlink-privilege skips\n- fresh Python 3.13.13 wheel install and LLM-disabled qualification PASS; 12/12 queries\n- two fresh 1,928-file PR5 scans: all 10 canonical projections byte-identical; zero canonical-table row differences\n- cache proof: 4,165 hits / 0 misses\n- compiler AST evidence: 378/394 translation units (84 MAPPED, 294 PARTIAL)\n- sealed PR5 certification PASS; independent 12/12-file verification; zero integrity errors\n\n## Gate\nPR5 remains CALIBRATION PARTIAL. Human-surface closure remains 347 bound / 59 partial / 82 unresolved. H-001 remains frozen and source-uninspected.",
